	<h2>What is Online Timer</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Online Timer</strong> is a set of time tools that run right in the browser:
		<a href="/en/temporizador/">countdown timer</a>, <a href="/en/cronometro/">stopwatch with laps</a>,
		<a href="/en/pomodoro/">pomodoro</a>, <a href="/en/intervalos/">intervals</a>,
		<a href="/en/meditacao/">meditation</a> and <a href="/en/sequencias/">sequences</a> of steps. Everything in one
		place, without installing anything and with the same design on any device.
	</p>

	<h2>Why we built it</h2>
	<p>
		Most online timers break the simple promise of a clock: full of ads, asking for a sign-up or losing the time when
		you switch tabs. Here it is different — the time is kept by the system clock, so it stays correct even with your
		phone locked or the app in the background.
	</p>

	<h2>Our principles</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Privacy first:</strong> no tracking, no analytics and no personal data.</li>
		<li><strong>Fast and offline:</strong> it is a PWA; install it and use it even without internet.</li>
		<li><strong>Focus:</strong> fullscreen mode, a huge dial and zero distractions.</li>
		<li><strong>Free forever:</strong> every feature unlocked, without subscription and without ads.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Our tools</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/en/temporizador/">Online timer</a> — countdown with ready-made presets.</li>
		<li><a href="/en/cronometro/">Stopwatch</a> — counts up and marks laps.</li>
		<li><a href="/en/pomodoro/">Pomodoro</a> — focus and break cycles.</li>
		<li><a href="/en/intervalos/">Intervals</a> — HIIT, tabata and workouts.</li>
		<li><a href="/en/meditacao/">Meditation</a> — guided breathing at your own pace.</li>
		<li><a href="/en/sequencias/">Sequences</a> — several steps with an alert at the end of each.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Talk to us</h2>
	<p>
		Have a suggestion, found a problem or want a new tool? Write to
		<a href="/en/contato/">contact</a> — we read every message.
	</p>
